<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">iron-will</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Iron Will</ansi> spell fortifies a target's mind and spirit, sharpening their
willpower and raising their resistance to magical and rhetoric attacks.
Unlike shield spells that form an outer barrier, Iron Will works from
within -- tempering the target's own mental resolve.

The effect lasts for a long time, making it a strong pre-fight buff.
It costs more than lighter enhancement spells, but the duration makes
it worthwhile for extended fights or dangerous zones.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast iron-will</ansi>              Fortifies yourself.
  <ansi fg="command">cast iron-will [target]</ansi>     Fortifies a nearby ally.

<ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">6</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Target:      </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Single ally (or self)</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">None -- help spells always apply</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Duration:    </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Long (scales with spellcasting skill)</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Effects:     </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Willpower boost + magical and conviction mitigation</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">45</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Enhancement</ansi>

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - Boosts willpower, which improves spell damage and magical defenses.
  - Adds direct mitigation against magical and conviction damage channels.
  - Stacks with Chrysalis Cocoon for broad multi-channel protection.
  - Casting again while Iron Will is active overwrites the existing buff.

